{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And Moses went down from the mountain to the people and he sanctified the people</b> — This teaches here that even this statement in which it says <b>And YHWH said to Moses: Go to the people</b>, was on the mountain, for Moses would go up there every time to speak with Him. And in the Mekhilta (here) they expounded it as teaching that Moses did not turn to his own affairs and did not go to his house at all, but rather <b>from the mountain to the people</b>."], :book :exodus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:10:54.453835014Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}